    {
      "text": "Let the waters under the heaven be gathered together unto one place, Gen. 1:9 (Moses 2:9; Abr. 4:9). they shall be one flesh, Gen. 2:24 (Matt. 19:5; Mark 10:8; 1 Cor. 6:16; Eph. 5:31; D&C 49:16; Moses 3:24; Abr. 5:18). the people is one, and they have all one language, Gen. 11:6. Lord our God is one Lord, Deut. 6:4 (Mark 12:29). he cannot answer him one of a thousand, Job 9:3. Two are better than one, Eccl. 4:9. I will set up one shepherd over them, Ezek. 34:23. they shall become one in thine hand, Ezek. 37:17.",
